        <p class="lead">For the mind that won't switch off: the overthinking, the racing thoughts, the constant bracing for what's next. A direct, practical path to quieting the loop. In-person in Houston&#39;s Clear Lake area and statewide via telehealth.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
