            <p>Tight chest, racing heart, the sudden surge that feels like something is wrong. We work on understanding panic and shrinking its hold so it stops running the show.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="light-card reveal">
            <small>High-Functioning Anxiety</small>
            <h3>Fine On The Outside</h3>
            <p>Hitting every mark while quietly bracing all day. We get underneath the drive and the dread so you can perform without the constant cost. <a class="inline-link" href="anxiety.html" style="color: var(--gold); font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline;">More on anxiety &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="light-card reveal">
            <small>Social &amp; Performance Anxiety</small>
